      "created_at": "2018-08-19T18:51:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Technically, neither Ennead members nor scions “enter play.” They are simply moved from their reserve areas into a play area. The phrasing is a little different, but neither goes from out of play to in play.  Exploit Vulnerability shouldn’t work on either of them, either, for example.</p>\n<p>However, if Phrase overflowed an Aeon Man, what card would be played? I’d say the heroes could choose between the OblivAeon or Scion deck (assuming both OblivAeon and a scion were present in the zone).</p>",
