    {
      "id": 221514,
      "name": "robertmaxfreeman",
      "username": "robertmaxfreeman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/robertmaxfreeman/{size}/2147_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-08-20T02:11:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, so to make sure I've got all this right:</p><p>1. Parse's Buffer Overflow doesn't work on Scions, because the Scions aren't villain cards. Villain cards come from villain decks. So Buffer Overflow can work on the Oblivaeon, Scion, or Aeon Men decks, but not the Scions or the Ennead.</p><p>2. A Scion entering play will trigger Parse's Updated Intel card, but she can't look at the bottom of the Scion pile, because it's not a deck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:54:12.678Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
