      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Okay, so to make sure I&#39;ve got all this right:</p><p>1. Parse&#39;s Buffer Overflow doesn&#39;t work on Scions, because the Scions aren&#39;t villain cards. Villain cards come from villain decks. So Buffer Overflow can work on the Oblivaeon, Scion, or Aeon Men decks, but not the Scions or the Ennead.</p><p>2. A Scion entering play will trigger Parse&#39;s Updated Intel card, but she can&#39;t look at the bottom of the Scion pile, because it&#39;s not a deck.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
